  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Cold-send question",
      "items": [
        "Where the host can ask, the refusal is a question: Send anyway goes through; Don't send, dismissed or no answer in 5 minutes holds the send (0 AI credits).",
        "Where it cannot ask (copilot -p) the old refuse-once message appears, then the abort. Resend to pay.",
        "session.abort() is not awaited: awaiting it inside the hook deadlocks. Awaiting select() there did not, measured live 12 Oct 2026 in Copilot CLI 1.0.95 and VS Code.",
        "Asked once per cold episode (refused.json, 7 days); later sends go through with the note. A queued prompt during a running turn is only priced."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Limits",
      "items": [
        "Early eviction: Luna was served cold at 29 of 30 min. The guard trusts cacheExpiresAt and stays quiet; the report counts a prefix break.",
        "The price is an estimate: last input plus answer, not your new message.",
        "With auto, the next prompt may use a different model than the one priced.",
        "copilot -p: the guard works, but slash commands go to the model as text."
      ]
    }
  ]
